"take into account the\n"
"            duration which is not in the rendering (look for the template, "
"read, inheritance,\n"
"            compilation...). During rendering, the global time also takes "
"part of the time to make\n"
"            the profile as well as some part not logged in the function "
"generated by the qweb."
msgstr ""
"Mogoče se čas \"t-call\" ne ujema s skupnim časom\n"
"            predloge. To je zato, ker globalni čas (v spustnem seznamu) ne "
"upošteva\n"
"            trajanja, ki ni del upodabljanja (iskanje predloge, branje, "
"dedovanje,\n"
"            prevajanje ...). Med upodabljanjem globalni čas vključuje tudi "
"del časa za izdelavo\n"
"            profila in del časa, ki ni zabeležen v funkciji, ki jo ustvari "
"qweb."

